1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,174
Three examinable facts.

2
00:00:02,174 --> 00:00:08,229
The title, A Day, is not hers: her editors added it in eighteen ninety.

3
00:00:08,229 --> 00:00:11,171
The poem was written around eighteen sixty.

4
00:00:11,171 --> 00:00:17,500
And the mark at the end of the first line is her famous dash, a held breath rather than a stop.

